    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Explore Stacked Bar Charts\r\n\r\nInvestigate how code changes affect a stacked bar chart of mythical creature sightings.\r\n\r\n1. Run the program and examine the chart.\r\n2. Ask AI Tutor to explain `groupby()`, `sum()`, and `unstack()`. Remove `.unstack()`, run the program, and observe what changes. Then restore it.\r\n3. Change the grouping from `Year` to `Region`. Update the axis label and title.\r\n4. Test two appearance settings: `stacked`, legend `loc`, `color`, or label rotation. Run the program after each change and keep the settings that make the chart clearest.\r\n\r\n:::: details [Need Help?]\r\n\r\nAsk AI Tutor to explain the code or show an example of a chart setting. Make and test the change yourself.\r\n\r\n::::",
    "ai_tutor_available": "false",
